gdpr.body:
Hello {broker},

I ask you to erase all personal data you hold about me, under Article 17 of the GDPR (or UK GDPR), and to stop processing it, including for marketing and for sale or sharing with others (Article 21). Please also tell me what data you held and where it came from (Article 15).

Name: {name}
Email: {email}

Please reply within one month, as Article 12(3) requires.

Thank you,
{name}

ccpa.body:
Hello {broker},

Under the California Consumer Privacy Act as amended by the CPRA, I ask you to delete the personal information you have collected about me, and not to sell or share it.

Name: {name}
Email: {email}

Please confirm within 45 days.

Thank you,
{name}

pdpl.body:
Hello {broker},

Under the personal data protection law that applies to me (for example the UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 or the Saudi Personal Data Protection Law), I ask you to erase the personal data you hold about me and stop processing it.

Name: {name}
Email: {email}

Please confirm when it is done.

Thank you,
{name}
